OL,3,GNEWSAFallen tree blocks trains to
OL,4,AStansted Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain passengers have been urged not to
OL,7,Ftravel after a fallen tree blocked a
OL,8,Frailway line.
OL,10,FEarlier this evening, Greater Anglia
OL,11,Fsaid the tree had fallen near Stansted
OL,12,FMountfitchet in Essex and had affected
OL,13,Fpower to the overhead wires.
OL,15,FAffected routes included Stansted
OL,16,FExpress services between London
OL,17,FLiverpool Street and Stansted Airport,
OL,18,Fas well as Greater Anglia services to
OL,19,FCambridge North, and the Hertfordshire
OL,20,Ftowns of Broxbourne and Bishop's
OL,21,FStortford.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
